135
00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:21.900
And unlike anything I'd ever directed in the past, I was given a floor plan and asked to

136
00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:27.020
draw out the performance of the camera operators, which direction they would go and which direction

137
00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:32.160
