314
00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:27.480
An earworm is a bit of a melody or bit of a song that becomes stuck in your head.

315
00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:28.860
Oh, yes.

316
00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:33.480
The researcher's name is James Calaris, and he studied this phenomenon.

317
00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:36.780
Why do bits of songs get stuck in our heads?

318
00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.380
He said that it happens to almost everyone at some point in their life,

319
00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:44.260
but he found that it did happen more to women and musicians.

320
00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:45.220
Hmm.

321
00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:45.880
Huh.

