1133
00:53:42.720 --> 00:53:46.800
I, why, why is it so funny?

1134
00:53:47.280 --> 00:53:51.020
She's just so good at playing those like emotional beats.

1135
00:53:51.020 --> 00:53:52.840
And I just love her.

1136
00:53:53.000 --> 00:53:54.140
I love it too.

1137
00:53:54.360 --> 00:53:55.360
I really love it.

1138
00:53:55.860 --> 00:54:00.680
Jenna, Pam is working so hard at her desk, 14 minutes, 49 seconds.

