00:54:58.360 --> 00:55:05.820
And then the next morning opens with Pam waking up to a phone call from Jim.

1163
00:55:06.340 --> 00:55:07.500
He got her breakfaSt.

1164
00:55:07.800 --> 00:55:08.440
He got her breakfaSt.

