1173
00:55:33.900 --> 00:55:34.820
That's what they decided.

1174
00:55:35.020 --> 00:55:37.460
But no detail went unturned, you guys.

1175
00:55:37.620 --> 00:55:40.280
This is the point, that there was a whole conversation about,

1176
00:55:40.440 --> 00:55:42.480
should there be orange juice or coffee?

1177
00:55:42.640 --> 00:55:45.120
That's how much thought was put into all of these moments.

1178
00:55:45.540 --> 00:55:48.520
Well, you know, Pam does not regularly drink coffee, you know?

1179
00:55:48.580 --> 00:55:49.440
She drinks tea.

1180
00:55:49.440 --> 00:55:51.640
So I think orange juice was the right choice.

1181
00:55:51.820 --> 00:55:52.000
Yeah.

1182
00:55:52.360 --> 00:55:57.200
Well, Pam explains in a talking head that she worked until 2.45 a.m.

1183
00:55:57.200 --> 00:56:01.820
And then she had to decide between spending the night with Michael and Dwight in the office

1184
00:56:01.820 --> 00:56:06.660
